# Clip: approval_flow.py in replay mode. Real output, no key, no network, no Docker.
Hide
Type "bash --noprofile --norc" Enter
Type "export PS1='$ ' && cd @REPO@" Enter
Type "export UV_NO_PROGRESS=1" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "uv run --extra otel python examples/approval_flow.py" Sleep 600ms Enter
Wait+Screen@120s /audit log verified/
Sleep 14s
